      139.15,
      318.91,
      451.21,
      347.18
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 30 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52) (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect as amended is to expand theCategories of persons required to keep instruments.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
