  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      357.31,
      451.18,
      395.18
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3 : This clause amends section 32 of the principal enactment and the legal effectas amended is to empower the Minister to make rules for the issue of security features to beaffixed on an excisable article and to levy charges for the provision of such security features,with a view to eliminate any revenue loss from duties on an excisable article.",
