      161.85,
      250.97,
      401.89,
      274.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      286.97,
      401.87,
      310.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Excise (Amendment)Act, No. of 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      322.97,
      401.92,
      358.31
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 30 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52)(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyamended as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      370.97,
      401.88,
      442.31
    ],
    "text": "(1)in subsection (1) by the substitution for the words\u201cEvery person who manufactures or sells excisablearticle under a licence\u201d of the words \u201cEvery personwho imports, exports, transports, manufactures,sells, possess or stores any excisable article under alicence, permit or pass;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      454.97,
      401.88,
      490.31
    ],
    "text": "(2)in the marginal note to that section for the words\u201ccertain licensees\u201d of the words \u201cholder of a licence,permit or pass\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      502.97,
      401.88,
      538.31
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 32 of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the insertion immediately after paragraph (j) ofthe following new paragraphs:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      170.13,
      550.97,
      401.87,
      598.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(ja)prescribing the types of security features to beaffixed on an excisable article when such excisablearticle is imported, exported, transported,manufactured, sold, possessed or stored;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      174.57,
      610.97,
      401.89,
      670.31
    ],
    "text": "(jb)levying charges for issuing of the security featuresreferred to in paragraph (ja) to be affixed on anexcisable article when such excisable article isimported, exported, transported, manufactured,sold, possessed or stored;\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
